; realizarpago.com — registros tal como estaban en Hostinger el 2026-09-11.
; Para importar en Cloudflare → DNS → Records → Import and Export → Import.
; Los A/AAAA de @ se cambian a 89.117.150.148 SOLO cuando el WordPress ya esté restaurado y probado.
$ORIGIN realizarpago.com.
$TTL 300

@	300	IN	A	191.96.144.59
@	300	IN	A	195.35.60.7
@	300	IN	AAAA	2a02:4780:1d:b4:8272:8ef8:4aed:3e25
@	300	IN	AAAA	2a02:4780:21:354f:adab:4a19:2efb:e2d7
@	300	IN	MX	5 mx1.hostinger.com.
@	300	IN	MX	10 mx2.hostinger.com.
@	300	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 include:_spf.mail.hostinger.com ~all"
www	300	IN	CNAME	www.realizarpago.com.cdn.hstgr.net.
autoconfig	300	IN	CNAME	autoconfig.mail.hostinger.com.
autodiscover	300	IN	CNAME	autodiscover.mail.hostinger.com.
hostingermail-a._domainkey	300	IN	CNAME	hostingermail-a.dkim.mail.hostinger.com.
hostingermail-b._domainkey	300	IN	CNAME	hostingermail-b.dkim.mail.hostinger.com.
hostingermail-c._domainkey	300	IN	CNAME	hostingermail-c.dkim.mail.hostinger.com.
_dmarc	300	IN	TXT	"v=DMARC1; p=none"
